%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: IsScriptRunning('tutorial')
goto: DuringTutorial

cond: true
goto: SmallTalk

%rec: Nodes
%type: npc multiline

name: DuringTutorial
npc: I am trying to teach you something here. Pay attention.
#
o_text: Cut the crap, Grim. Just give me the keys.
o_id: keys_now
o_cond: !HasFlag('grimKeysGiven')
o_goto: GiveKeys
#
o_text: Fine, let's get back to it.
o_goto: GoodbyeGoOn

name: SmallTalk
npc: What do you want, youngster?
#
o_text: Can I have the keys to the apartment?
o_id: ask_keys
o_cond: !HasFlag('grimKeysGiven')
o_goto: GiveKeys
# Starter Mission
o_text: I got this message from a guy named Jacob. What's the deal?
o_id: ask_jacob
o_cond: HasFlag('JobRead(starter)')
o_goto: TellAboutJacob
#
o_text: About that job for Jacob. How should I play it?
o_id: job_advice
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(starter)') && !HasFlag('QuestCompleted(starter)')
o_goto: JobAdvice
#
o_text: So what can you tell me about the neighborhood?
o_goto: AreaKnowledge
#
o_text: What did you say we were doing last night?
o_goto: LastNight
#
o_text: You've been quiet since you gave me the keys. Planning something?
o_id: ask_leaving
o_cond: HasFlag('grimKeysGiven')
o_goto: Leaving_Hint
#
o_text: Never mind.
o_id: bye
o_goto: Goodbye
#

name: GiveKeys
npc: In a rush? Fine, here you go.
+ (Grim hands you the keys to the apartment.)
+ Lose them and the keypad takes 0451. Don't tell the other tenants.
effect: SetFlag('grimKeysGiven')
effect: StopScript('tutorial')
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'home_keys')
effect: EndConversation

name: GoodbyeGoOn
npc: Right, let's get back to business.
effect: EndConversation

name: Goodbye
npc: Good luck out there.
effect: EndConversation

name: Leaving_Hint
npc: (He turns his glass.) A man who retires and keeps his old bar stool isn't retired. He's waiting.
+ I'm done waiting. Don't come looking. You'll hear from me when it matters.
#
o_text: Suit yourself, old man.
o_goto: Goodbye
#
o_text: I wanted to ask something else.
o_goto: SmallTalk

### Starter Mission BEGIN ###

name: TellAboutJacob
npc: Yeah, Jacob Thorne. A new client. I am not sure I like him.
#
o_text: I see, thanks.
o_goto: Goodbye
#
o_text: Do you know where I can find him?
o_id: jacob_location
o_goto: TellJacobLocation
#
o_text: I wanted to ask something else.
o_goto: SmallTalk


name: TellJacobLocation
npc: He has an apartment in the eastern residential district. Take a taxi, you can't miss it.
+ I see you want to re-negotiate the contract? Clever.
+ (He marks the location on your map.)
effect: SetFlag('LocationKnown(jacobs_home)')
#
o_text: Thanks.
o_id: location_thanks
o_goto: Goodbye
#
o_text: I wanted to ask something else.
o_goto: SmallTalk

name: JobAdvice
npc: (Grim scratches his beard.) The Ripperdoc, Daniel Harker. Runs the clinic at the hospital.
+ Jacob wants his money. You drop 250 sat in the dead drop by the tree, you keep the rest.
+ How you get it? Three ways I know of. Muscle, mouth or fingers.
#
o_text: Muscle?
o_id: advice_muscle
o_goto: AdviceForce
#
o_text: Mouth?
o_id: advice_mouth
o_goto: AdviceTalk
#
o_text: Fingers?
o_id: advice_fingers
o_goto: AdviceSneak
#
o_text: Got it, thanks.
o_id: advice_done
o_goto: Goodbye

name: AdviceForce
npc: Walk in, tell the Doc it's money or violence. Most folks pay.
+ Or skip the middleman. Jacob lives over in the eastern residential district.
+ A client who's dead doesn't collect any debts. Just know he doesn't come alone.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: AdviceTalk
npc: Harker is not stupid. Talk to him and he might cut you a deal.
+ Or go talk to Jacob himself. Renegotiate, or convince him to drop the whole thing.
+ A sharp suit makes people listen. A gun in plain sight makes them stop listening.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: AdviceSneak
npc: Nobody has to know where the money came from.
+ The Doc keeps a stash in his operating room. Jacob keeps a safe in his apartment.
+ Paying a man with his own sat. Now that has style.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

### Starter Mission END ###

### General Knowledge BEGIN ###

name: AreaKnowledge
npc: Well, all of Edge Haven is a bit of a dump. It's like the wild west out here.
+ But you can also make a fortune. If you know how to play the game.
+ The two major corps, Eschaton Biotech and Bushido-ArmaTech, are always at each other's throats.
+ They have their fingers in everything around here. And then there's the gangs.
#
o_text: What's the deal with the Edge Haven?
o_goto: EdgeHaven
#
o_text: Tell me about Eschaton Biotech.
o_goto: EschatonBiotech
#
o_text: Tell me about Bushido-ArmaTech.
o_goto: BushidoArmaTech
#
o_text: Tell me about the gangs.
o_goto: Gangs
#
o_text: I wanted to ask something else.
o_goto: SmallTalk

name: EdgeHaven
npc: The mega-city of the poor. The last stop before the wasteland.
+ All the rich guys are already up in space. We are the leftovers.
+ They are using the sky-hook to export everything that's still valuable.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: EschatonBiotech
npc: One-half religious cult, one-half biotech company. They have a kind of anti-tech agenda.
+ Hypocrites, if you ask me. They are big into bio-engineering and gene manipulation.
+ As you can guess, they are not very popular with the other corps.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: BushidoArmaTech
npc: The other big player in town. They are all about the tech.
+ They are the ones who built the sky-hook. And they are the ones who keep it running.
+ Military-industrial complex, if you ask me. They are always looking for new ways to make a buck.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: Gangs
npc: Mostly dumb kids who beat each other up for a few breadcrumbs.
+ But there are a few who are more organized. They are the ones you should watch out for.
+ Flesh & Bone and the Cognetic Bastards are worth mentioning.
#
o_text: Tell me more about Flesh & Bone.
o_goto: FleshAndBone
#
o_text: Tell me more about the Cognetic Bastards.
o_goto: CogneticBastards
#
o_text: I wanted to ask something else.
o_goto: SmallTalk

name: FleshAndBone
npc: They really, really dislike the augmented. They are all about the purity of the flesh.
+ What they do like is beating up people who are different.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: CogneticBastards
npc: I don't know much about them. They are a secretive bunch.
+ Rumor has it they are following some kind of Artificial Intelligence.
+ Did not run into them myself. And I am not planning to.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

### General Knowledge END ###

### Last Night BEGIN ###

name: LastNight
npc: Why do you ask? You don't remember? We were drinking. A lot.
#
o_text: I see. Thanks.
o_goto: Goodbye
#
o_text: It is a bit odd that I don't remember anything. Where did we go?
o_goto: WhereDidWeGo
#
o_text: I wanted to ask something else.
o_goto: SmallTalk

name: WhereDidWeGo
npc: We went to the "La Boom". Maybe you should stop drinking so much.
+ Stop asking these questions and get back to work.
#
o_text: Right. I am leaving.
o_goto: Goodbye
#
o_text: I wanted to ask something else.
o_goto: SmallTalk

name: Leaving
npc: Alright, youngster. I think you should be fine on your own now.
+ And don't forget: Attitude is everything.
effect: RunScriptLeave('grim')
effect: StopScript('tutorial')
effect: EndConversation
